{"unit_id":"aski0006__dsh-git-graph-panel#card-zh","repo":"aski0006/dsh-git-graph-panel","commit":"97553b8e5d7747e2190fc4238813f618e14eac1a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-graph-panel 是一个面向 DSH Web 的 Git 图插件，会在右侧栏启动页提供 Git Graph 卡片并打开独立标签页。Host 端读取当前会话项目目录或首个 workspace，通过 Git 获取提交、分支、标签和工作区状态；浏览器端将提交历史绘制为带泳道和合并连线的 SVG 图，并显示作者、相对时间、改动与冲突数量。用户可刷新数据并复制完整提交号，历史最多显示 120 条。适合在 DSH 界面快速查看当前项目的 Git 历史；运行时需要本机可用的 Git。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:269-305","lib/client.js:561-657"]}
{"unit_id":"aski0006__dsh-git-graph-panel#card-en","repo":"aski0006/dsh-git-graph-panel","commit":"97553b8e5d7747e2190fc4238813f618e14eac1a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-git-graph-panel adds a Git Graph tab to the DSH Web sidebar. It reads the current project’s Git history and draws commits, branches, and merges as an SVG graph. The view also shows authors, working tree changes, conflicts, and lets users copy commit IDs. Requires Git locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:269-305","lib/client.js:561-657"]}
