{"unit_id":"aski0006__dsh-git-graph-panel#feature-1","repo":"aski0006/dsh-git-graph-panel","commit":"97553b8e5d7747e2190fc4238813f618e14eac1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-graph-panel 的功能「提交图浏览」：在 DSH Web 右侧栏打开 Git Graph 标签页，以泳道和连线展示当前项目的提交及合并关系，窗口最多包含最近 120 条提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:208-269","lib/client.js:818-860","lib/index.js:251-260"]}
